Package: gnome-shell-extension-deepmon
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: fstronin <fstronin@localhost>
Installed-Size: 115
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 50), gjs, gir1.2-secret-1
Recommends: gnome-keyring
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Description: DeepSeek API balance and spending indicator for GNOME Shell
 Shows the DeepSeek API balance and today's spending in the top bar, a popup
 with today/7/30 day totals and a per-day chart, and a notification when the
 daily spending limit is exceeded. Spending is derived from balance deltas,
 so its precision equals the polling interval. The API key is stored in the
 GNOME keyring, with a 0600 file as fallback.
